				<r3d:description language="eng">India Votes is India&#039;s largest public elections resource. It covers all Lok Sabha elections since 1952 and all State elections since 1977. IndiaVotes already has data on over 200 national as well as state elections and will be enriched with inputs from users.
Even though election data is available online, it is not easily searchable or cannot be consumed in structured formats necessary for analysis. IndiaVotes aims to become the open-source equivalent and Wikipedia of election information in India.</r3d:description>
